    },
    "funFacts": [
     "النَّهْضَة, “the rising”, is the name of the Arab cultural revival of the 19th century."
    ],
    "pitfalls": [
     "The present has a: يَنْهَضُ (not *يَنْهُضُ).",
     "نَهَضَ is getting up from lying or sitting; waking up is اِسْتَيْقَظَ."
    ],
    "subtleties": [
     "In speech قَامَ is more common; نَهَضَ is the usual written word for getting out of bed."
