     "After لَمْ the merged form takes -a: لَمْ أَسْتَحِمَّ “I didn’t shower” (also لَمْ أَسْتَحْمِمْ)."
    ],
    "subtleties": [
     "One verb for shower and bath; both happen in the حَمَّام."
    ]
